# Managed by mise. macOS only.
#
# The signing and login key is the Secure Enclave handle at
# ~/.ssh/id_ecdsa_sk: ssh finds it under that default name on its own, and
# SSH_SK_PROVIDER (zshenv, config.fish, the ssh-carrying plists) points it at
# /usr/lib/ssh-keychain.dylib instead of a USB reader. No secret lives in the
# handle; the key is the machine's CTK identity (sc_auth list-ctk-identities).
Host *
  UseKeychain yes
  AddKeysToAgent yes
